{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"effective-interest-rate-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"no","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"effective-interest-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["effective-interest-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"nb-NO","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"For periodisk sammensatt, APY = (ZXQPH0000QXZ + APR ÷ m) ^m − ZXQPH0001QXZ, hvor m er antall sammensatte perioder per år. For å konvertere APY tilbake til nominell APR, bruk APR = m × ((ZXQPH0002QXZ + APY) ^( ZXQPH0003QXZ/ m) − ZXQPH0004QXZ). Kontinuerlig sammensatt bruker APY = e^APR − ZXQPH0005QXZ. Skriv inn satser som prosenter, for eksempel ZXQPH0006QXZ betyr ZXQPH0007QXZ.","record_id":"090fc1b32f4bfa9d4784032235c907b187b7a3e03cace90671cd01d359bed80f","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":4.209218175750038,"source":"For periodic compounding, APY = (1 + APR ÷ m)^m − 1, where m is the number of compounding periods per year. To convert APY back to nominal APR, use APR = m × ((1 + APY)^(1/m) − 1). Continuous compounding uses APY = e^APR − 1. Enter rates as percentages; for example, 12 means 12%.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"fe78b074adbd1d99e0a797d7cf4aab3016d94b38ff9812d5eef74ae6613339fa","status":"machine-draft","translation":"For periodisk sammensatt, APY = (1 + APR ÷ m) ^m − 1, hvor m er antall sammensatte perioder per år. For å konvertere APY tilbake til nominell APR, bruk APR = m × ((1 + APY) ^( 1/ m) − 1). Kontinuerlig sammensatt bruker APY = e^APR − 1. Skriv inn satser som prosenter, for eksempel 12 betyr 12%.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
